<title>UK: UK's Blair makes Darling Chief Sec to Treasury.</title>
<headline>UK's Blair makes Darling Chief Sec to Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's new Labour Prime Minister Tony Blair on Saturday confirmed Alistair Darling as Chief Secretary to the Treasury, government sources said.</p>
<p>Gavin Strang was named Transport Secretary and Jack Cunningham was appointed Agriculture Secretary. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7768</p>
